        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dr. Seuss, Theodor Seuss Geisel, Dennis Kenney\n- Characters: The Grinch\n- Works: Dr. Seuss' How the Grinch Stole Christmas!\n- Events: New York press tour\n\nFacts:\n- Theodor Seuss Geisel was an American author, political cartoonist, poet, animator, book publisher, and artist who used the pen name Dr. Seuss.\n- Theodor Seuss Geisel was born on March 2, 1904, and died on September 24, 1991.\n- Dr. Seuss is best known for authoring children's books.\n- Dr. Seuss created the fictional character the Grinch.\n- Dennis Kenney is best known for portraying the Grinch in the New York press tour of \"Dr Seuss' How The Grinch Stole Christmas!\".",
